findings.description:
These success criteria map cleanly to tasks:
- the hash narrowing, covered in both directions (T1/T2, T17 step 5);
- the floor refusal and the unversioned refusal (T7/T8);
- version-scoped `GraduatedConfig` matching (T11/T12);
- the non-empty-offers guarantee, and the lapse, pruned-file and exhausted cases (T13/T14);
- the `graduate` refusal (T15/T16);
- the surface-agnostic core (T16);
- the final regression gate (T17).

No scope creep was found: each task traces to the slice design. Sequencing is valid and has no circular dependencies.
